<title>HUNGARY: CESI index hits new record, ends at 1,569.37 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index hits new record, ends at 1,569.37 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index hit the fourth record daily high in a row on Tuesday, closing at 1,569.37 points, up 2.08 points or 0.13 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
